    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson is delighted to present this superb three-bedroom family home to the market, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after and mature Foxrock Mount development. Nestled in a quiet cul-de-sac, this attractive property is presented in very good condition throughout and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation, a private south-west facing rear garden and off-street parking, making it an ideal home for families,  and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been well maintained and is both practical and spacious. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a spacious living room, providing a comfortable space for relaxing and entertaining. To the rear, the kitchen/dining room overlooks the garden and offers an excellent layout for everyday family living. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms, comprising two generous double bedrooms, one with en-suite and a spacious single bedroom, all serviced by a family bathroom with bath and shower.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property enjoys a private south-west facing rear garden, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the afternoon and evening sunshine, laid with lawn and patio.  There is also a large storage shed. To the front, a cobblelock driveway provides off-street parking.  Presented in very good condition, this wonderful home is ready for immediate occupation or letting.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nFoxrock Mount is a mature and highly regarded residential development, renowned for its peaceful setting, attractive tree-lined surroundings and excellent convenience. Situated within a quiet cul-de-sac, the property enjoys a superb location close to Foxrock Village, Stillorgan, Cabinteely and Cornelscourt, with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and local amenities all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by a range of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while nearby Cabinteely Park, Kilbogget Park and the Dublin Mountains provide outstanding recreational and leisure facilities. Excellent public transport links, including the QBC and LUAS at Carrickmines, together with immediate access to the M50 and N11, ensure effortless connectivity to Dublin City Centre, Sandyford Business District, Leopardstown, Dundrum Town Centre and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation, a private south-west facing garden, off-street parking and an enviable Foxrock address, 20 Foxrock Mount represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of South Dublin's most desirable residential locations."
      },
      {
